on will undoubtedly enrich our research landscape and inspire our students to strive for excellence.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1011, "end": 1161, "text": "Fontaine, who assumed his new role earlier this month, expressed his enthusiasm for the opportunity to contribute to UPM's vibrant research ecosystem."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1162, "end": 1343, "text": "\"I am honored to join this esteemed institution and collaborate with talented colleagues who share my passion for advancing scientific knowledge,\" he said in an exclusive interview."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1344, "end": 1508, "text": "\"The University of Putra Malaysia's commitment to excellence and its state-of-the-art facilities make it the ideal platform for me to pursue my research interests.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1509, "end": 1704, "text": "According to sources close to the university, Fontaine's appointment is expected to have a significant impact on UPM's research output, with several high-profile projects already in the pipeline."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1705, "end": 1856, "text": "His expertise is anticipated to bolster the institution's research capabilities, particularly in the areas of sustainability and environmental science."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1857, "end": 2073, "text": "Data released by the university reveals that Fontaine's arrival has already sparked a surge in research collaborations, with a 25% increase in international partnerships and a 30% rise in research grant applications."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2074, "end": 2078, "text": "\"Dr."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2079, "end": 2157, "text": "Fontaine's presence has created a buzz among our research community,\" said Dr."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2158, "end": 2209, "text": "Norhayati Abdullah, Dean of the Faculty of Science."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2210, "end": 2371, "text": "\"His expertise and reputation have opened doors to new opportunities, and we are confident that his contributions will have a lasting impact on our institution.\""}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2372, "end": 2461, "text": "As Fontaine settles into his new role, the academic community is abuzz with anticipation."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2462, "end": 2600, "text": "With his impressive credentials and UPM's commitment to excellence, the stage is set for a new era of scientific discovery and innovation."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Montreal Heart Institute", "University of Putra Malaysia"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Montreal Heart Institute", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Putra Malaysia", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
